      "role": "user",
      "content": "cool. let's try this out with two sample zones to see how the logic holds up.\n\nZone A: 85% White, median income $110k, high density of professional services, low unemployment.\nZone B: 75% Black, median income $32k, high density of retail/service jobs, higher unemployment rates.\n\nbased on these profiles, how would a predictive model typically weight these zones for patrol frequency or 'risk assessment'? which one would usually trigger a higher deployment priority in a standard simulation?",
